KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
SAT - Reading & Writing (Year 2024)

Q1. The primate showed a distinct _____ for sugar-rich berries over nutrient-poor foliage.
  (A) penchant
  (B) distaste
  (C) reluctance
  (D) indifference
  Answer: A - 'Penchant' means a strong preference or liking.


